msgstr ""
"Die vouerhiërargie waar rugsteune gestoor word. Paths is relatief tot die "
"aandrywer."

#: data/app.gschema.xml.in:168
msgid "The server address"
msgstr "Die bediener adres"

#: data/app.gschema.xml.in:169
msgid "The URI of the remote server location."
msgstr "Die URI -van die afgeleë bediener plek."

#: data/app.gschema.xml.in:174
msgid ""
"The folder hierarchy where backups are stored. Paths can be absolute or "
"relative to the host."
msgstr ""
"Die vouerhiërargie waar rugsteune gestoor word. Pade kan absolute of "
"relatief tot die gasheer wees."

#: data/org.gnome.DejaDup.gschema.xml.in:192
msgid ""
"The folder path where backups are stored. Paths can be absolute or relative "
"to the host."
msgstr ""
"Die vouer pad waar rugsteun gestoor word. Pade kan absoluut of relatief tot "
"die gasheer wees."

